Lua 5.5.1 (https://www.lua.org), vendored unmodified from lua-5.5.1.tar.gz
(sha256 1c4b4068d67061f2a2231ad2b5422e77acea1487ea9890f6320af614f4373dce).
Only the language core and the libraries the mod sandbox exposes are kept:
the standalone interpreters (lua.c, luac.c) and the io, os, package and debug
libraries (liolib.c, loslib.c, loadlib.c, ldblib.c, linit.c) are left out.

